- mods/my-files: modified copy of Herdr's built-in "files" mod (version 0.1.12).
  Added: in-panel editing and saving, unsaved-buffer tracking, disk-change and
  conflict handling, CRLF-preserving saves, markdown preview, nano button, and
  drag-a-row-to-terminal path pasting.
- mods/my-tabs: modified copy of Herdr's built-in "tabs" mod (version 0.1.12).
  Added: a GitHub panel button.
- mods/my-status: modified copy of Herdr's built-in "workspace-status" mod (version 0.1.13).
  Added: CPU, RAM and GPU figures and a recent-usage dashboard.

- mods/my-new-menu: modified copy of Herdr's built-in "new-menu" mod (version 0.1.13).
  Added: a file viewer entry.

